    "detailed_description": "Apocalypse Delivery Service is an exciting survival and adventure game. <br />\r\nYou will enter a post-apocalyptic world where you play as a courier delivering packages. <br />\r\nBut don't think it will be easy! Your task is to find necessary items, survive, and most importantly, escape from the city.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHere's what awaits you:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3D world: The game is presented in three-dimensional graphics, allowing you to fully immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the post-apocalyptic world.<br />\r\nItem search: You will need to carefully explore the environment to find necessary items. It could be a door key, medicine, or other resources that will help you survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo get ready for an exciting adventure where every step could cost you your life",
